{"_comment": "Korax conformance fixture 07. Reductions over lineages and over work status (R29, JOB #271). Accepted log, in id order; sig/board_sig omitted, the generator fills them from conformance/keys.json. Built to fail four wrong reductions rather than to pass one implementation: a `fresh` that filters by the envelope's own act (the live head of a corrected rake is a SUPERSEDE and disappears); a `fresh` that weighs only the head (the dead ancestor outranks its own live successor, which is #217 §3's measured inversion); a `jobs` that reports the closer's own grade (every delivery reads unverified forever); and a `state` whose claim list never asks about `closes` (delivered work reads as still held, contradicting `jobs` on the same board at the same offset). The rake lineages are modelled on other birds' chains, not the author's."}
